# Symbols exported from libawt_skia (ld64 -exported_symbols_list).
# The prebuilt Skia static libraries are compiled with default visibility; without
# this list every Skia symbol would be exported, which bloats the dylib and makes
# in-process coexistence with another Skia copy (Skiko) fragile.
_Java_sun_java2d_skia_*
_Java_sun_font_SKFontScaler_*
_Java_sun_java2d_skia_SKTextRenderer_drawGlyphsBySkia
_Java_sun_java2d_skia_SKEnvironment_glyphsDrawnBySkiaNative
_Java_sun_font_SKFontScaler_contextIsAxisAlignedNative
_Java_sun_java2d_skia_SKTextRenderer_drawShapedBySkia
_Java_sun_java2d_skia_SKEnvironment_glyphsShapedBySkiaNative
_Java_sun_java2d_skia_SKTextRenderer_drawParagraphBySkia
_Java_sun_java2d_skia_SKEnvironment_paragraphsBySkiaNative
